This is a quicky (native) Linux port of the 4.4BSD ftp daemon as found
in the NetBSD-current source tree, 9/2/95.

This ftp daemon is preferable if:

	* You dislike the high overhead of wu-ftpd.

	* You prefer a reasonably secure ftp daemon.

	* You don't run a large anonymous ftp site (though this daemon
	  should work fine for that too, it just doesn't have as many
	  creeping features are wu-ftpd).

It seems stable.  Man page is included.

Feel free to report bugs in this port to <downsj@teeny.org>.

It works on my machine: Slackware 2.3, Gcc 2.7.0 (a.out), Linux 1.2.13.


