  Brisk is an Italian card game which uses a special deck of 40 cards - 4 
suits of 10 cards each.  The game is similar to euchre, and I have 
included a small primer text-file for people who don't know how to play.

XNetbrisk is a networked multiplayer X11 brisk card game - you can play 
against your friends (on other computers) or against a (simple) computer 
opponent!

  This has scanned in cards for the X11 client and the server supports 2 
player "chaos" play or 4 player team play.  

 I am releasing this under the GPL.

Enjoy!

